# Foxwarm Configuration
#
# This file is no longer used by Foxwarm.
# All configuration is now in YAML format under state/:
#
#   state/config.yaml   - Bot config, channels, LLM defaults, ports, feature flags
#   state/models.yaml   - Model providers and model lists
#
# See templates/models.example.yaml for a models config example.
# See docs/architecture.md for the full configuration reference.
#
# For Docker deployments, mount your config files into the container's
# state/ directory.
